        "text_jNgA76": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>From the founder: </strong>After years of suffering from chronic and unexplainable health issues, including PCOS (Polycystic Ovary Syndrome), Endometriosis and an autoimmune condition on my feminine area, I began a holistic healing journey to address the root cause of my ailments and reverse them naturally. This included switching out chemical-laden conventional clothing and synthetic, polyester (made from plastic) fabrics, for natural fiber alternatives. When I started wearing linen, my ‘incurable’ skin condition miraculously healed and my hormonal imbalances regulated. Soft, luxurious, modern and stylish 100% Organic linen underwear did not exist, so I decided to create it myself— and Heavenly Essentials was born.</p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
